  "description": "ASP.NET Core Health Checks integration for Vali-Blob — the unified cloud storage abstraction library for .NET.\n        Registers health check endpoints that probe the configured IBlobProvider (AWS S3, Azure Blob, GCP, OCI, Supabase, Local)\n        and report Healthy / Degraded / Unhealthy status via the standard Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks infrastructure.\n        Works with all Vali-Blob providers and integrates with existing /health endpoints and dashboards.\n        Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net6.0, net7.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
